### 4. Book slot 1 (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/customer/book
Content-Type: application/json

{ "slotId": 1 }

### 5. Metrics after booking (bookingsSucceeded should be 1 higher)
GET http://localhost:8080/metrics

