POST http://localhost:8080/api/customer/book
Content-Type: application/json

{ "slotId": 1 }

### 7. Metrics again (bookingsFailed should be 1 higher)
GET http://localhost:8080/metrics

### 8. Cancel the appointment (expect 200; use the id from request 4)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/customer/appointments/1

